    "title": "Snap! Mobile",
    "description": "Snap! Mobile is the essential software platform for athletics and activities. The Snap! Mobile app seamlessly connects to a program\u2019s Snap! Raise fundraising campaign and Snap! Store to create engagement on the go.\r\n\r\nFor Coaches and Group Leaders: Simplify your fundraising journey and create engagement with participants. The Snap! Mobile app will help you and your participants easily connect to your Snap! Raise fundraising campaigns and Snap! Store. Explore exciting new features like sharing your team\u2019s news and schedule directly with your fanbase through the app. \r\n\r\nFor Participants: The Snap! Mobile app seamlessly connects you to your program\u2019s Snap! Raise fundraiser and Snap! Store. Raise more with less effort during your fundraiser by inviting donors via email and text and viewing donations in the app. Shop the Snap! Store for the best custom gear to rep your program year-round. Stay updated on your program\u2019s schedule and news.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Snap! Mobile is the essential software platform for athletics and activities. The Snap! Mobile app seamlessly connects to a program\u2019s Snap! Raise fundraising campaign and Snap! Store to create engagement on the go.<br><br>For Coaches and Group Leaders: Simplify your fundraising journey and create engagement with participants. The Snap! Mobile app will help you and your participants easily connect to your Snap! Raise fundraising campaigns and Snap! Store. Explore exciting new features like sharing your team\u2019s news and schedule directly with your fanbase through the app. <br><br>For Participants: The Snap! Mobile app seamlessly connects you to your program\u2019s Snap! Raise fundraiser and Snap! Store. Raise more with less effort during your fundraiser by inviting donors via email and text and viewing donations in the app. Shop the Snap! Store for the best custom gear to rep your program year-round. Stay updated on your program\u2019s schedule and news.",
